@startuml
title SEQ-05 - Learning Item Semantic Edit and Revision Reset
autonumber
actor User
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
database DB as "product_gotit"

User -> Web: Open item detail
Web -> GotIt: GET /learning-items/:id
GotIt -> Core: Authenticate
GotIt -> DB: Load owned item/detail
GotIt --> Web: item + translations + updatedAt + evidence
User -> Web: Edit source/languages/meaning/type
Web --> User: Warn current learning evidence will reset
User -> Web: Confirm
Web -> GotIt: PATCH /learning-items/:id\nexpectedUpdatedAt + semantic patch
GotIt -> Core: Check vocabulary.write
critical Semantic update
  GotIt -> DB: SELECT owned item FOR UPDATE
  alt updatedAt differs
    GotIt --> Web: 409 stale/conflict
  else Current row
    GotIt -> GotIt: Validate language/sense/translation invariants
    GotIt -> DB: Increment learning_revision
    GotIt -> DB: Replace current translation state/history
    GotIt -> DB: Reset current skill/review/mastery projections
    GotIt -> DB: Clear revision-bound study image
    GotIt -> DB: Preserve attempts, occurrences, XP and historical provenance
  end
end
GotIt --> Web: Updated item detail
Web --> User: New revision and learning state
@enduml

